<title>ITALY: Italy's Ciampi to meet Dutch FinMin Zalm on Weds.</title>
<headline>Italy's Ciampi to meet Dutch FinMin Zalm on Weds.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dutch Finance Minister Gerrit Zalm will travel to Italy on Wednesday to meet Italian Treasury Minister Carlo Azeglio Ciampi, a source at the Treasury said.</p>
<p>The source said the two men were due to have lunch together and were likely to talk about European economic and monetary union (EMU). He gave no further details. -- Rome newsroom +396 6782501</p>
</text>
